  "base_commit": "848b86268261ec641e764e69eed7a1825937bd3b",
  "pr_number": 597,
  "issue_number": 593,
  "issue_title": "perf(serve): MoE CB batched prefill + Qwythos H3 GDN fidelity",
  "issue_body": "## Summary\n\nPort of the #585 serving win (that PR hit the 3-eval exhaust limit), plus the Qwythos H3 guard fix.\n\n1. **MoE hybrid batched prefill in `ContinuousBatchEngine`** \u2014 match `Qwen35Model` (`dense_ffn || n_experts > 0`). Main still required `dense_ffn`, so Qwen3.6 CB mixed load fell to the token loop (~468 pp / ~17s TTFT).\n2. **vLLM V1 decode-first continuous batching** \u2014 pack decode before prefill; keep hybrid batched GEMM under mix.\n3. **Qwythos H3 fidelity** \u2014 dense GDN stays bf16 at `N<=512` (prefill_check size); int8 GDN remains for longer prefills so CB @8k stays fast.\n\n## Proof of speedup\n\n> Measured on RTX 5090 (vast instance **45609349**). Eval recipe:  \n> `SPARKINFER_SCHED_POLICY=continuous SPARKINFER_PREFILL_MIX_MAX=0`  \n> `qwen3_gguf_cb_bench <gguf> 4 256 64 8192`\n\n- [x] Tested on **RTX 5090** (`sm_120`)\n\n**Decode tok/s** (single-seq, flat):\n\n| | decode tok/s |\n|---|--:|\n| before (main) | 299.4 |\n| after (this PR) | 299.7 |\n\n**Prefill pp tok/s** (Qwythos CB mixed-load `long_prefill_pp`):\n\n| | prefill pp tok/s |\n|---|--:|\n| before prefill (main) | 19380 |\n| after prefill (this PR) | 20880 |\n\n```text\n# RTX 5090 \u2014 instance 45609349 \u2014 SPARKINFER_KV_INT8=1\n# A/B same box: /root/sparkinfer-main (f29e514) vs /root/sparkinfer-pr (81c7ecd)\n\n# Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-UD-Q4_K_M  (scored CB TTFT)\n#   BEFORE: long_ttft_s=17.030  long_prefill_pp=468\n#   AFTER:  long_ttft_s=0.580   long_prefill_pp=14132\n#   \u2192 ~29.4\u00d7 faster CB TTFT\n\n# Qwythos-9B-Claude-Mythos-5-1M-Q4_K_M\n#   BEFORE: long_ttft_s=0.422   long_prefill_pp=19380\n#   AFTER:  long_ttft_s=0.392   long_prefill_pp=20880\n#   \u2192 ~8% faster CB TTFT / +8% mixed-load pp\n\n# H3 prefill_check @512 (fixes #585 Qwythos guard reject):\n#   BEFORE: Qwythos TOP1 0.6875 KL 0.0114  \u2192 H3 VETO\n#   AFTER:  Qwythos TOP1 0.9375 KL 0.0029  \u2192 pass\n#           Qwen3.6 TOP1 0.9375 KL 0.0048  \u2192 pass\n```\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] CB A/B vs same-box main (Qwen3.6 + Qwythos) on 45609349\n- [x] H3 prefill_check @512 both models\n- [x] Single-seq decode healthy\n- [ ] On-device eval @ `81c7ecd`: expect Qwen3.6 `eval-prefill:XL`; Qwythos H3 pass\n",
  "merged_at": "2026-07-23T20:32:14.000Z",
